WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:35.870
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:36.140 --> 01:40.060
[River of No Return]

3
01:40.140 --> 01:43.020
[Episode 6: Escape]

4
01:43.210 --> 01:44.470
You always say you want

5
01:44.509 --> 01:45.509
to leave Jinling.

6
01:45.920 --> 01:46.930
Where exactly do you want to go?

7
01:46.930 --> 01:48.190
Give it to me straight!

8
01:48.250 --> 01:50.070
Can you stop asking where I'm going?

9
01:50.070 --> 01:51.030
Come on, stop messing around.

10
01:51.030 --> 01:51.900
I'm not leaving.

11
01:51.900 --> 01:52.900
Come on, let's go.

12
01:55.450 --> 01:56.070
Yulu!

13
01:56.780 --> 01:57.310
Sweetie!

14
01:57.430 --> 01:58.289
I'm going home.

15
02:00.180 --> 02:00.790
Yulu!

16
02:10.430 --> 02:12.030
You three wait for me here.

17
02:14.130 --> 02:15.240
Act the part.

18
02:21.590 --> 02:22.790
Stay put right there!

19
02:27.640 --> 02:28.110
Stop.

20
02:28.520 --> 02:29.780
What's your business?

21
02:30.270 --> 02:31.870
I'm from Yingtian Prefecture prison—

22
02:31.870 --> 02:33.329
here to escort prisoners.

23
02:36.050 --> 02:37.710
Orders from the Brave Warriors Camp:

24
02:37.710 --> 02:40.370
you need Eunuch Zhu's warrant to leave the city.

25
02:40.370 --> 02:41.430
This thing of yours

26
02:41.490 --> 02:42.550
doesn't work here.

27
02:42.990 --> 02:44.990
Why do you need to leave the city now?

28
02:47.230 --> 02:49.640
It's an embarrassing matter.

29
02:51.079 --> 02:52.079
Do you see that guy

30
02:52.240 --> 02:53.100
in the small hat

31
02:53.150 --> 02:54.210
and green clothes?

32
02:54.650 --> 02:57.240
His wife and that opera performer in the cangue

33
02:57.240 --> 02:58.480
were having a secret rendezvous

34
02:58.480 --> 02:59.340
and got caught.

35
02:59.590 --> 03:00.800
Seriously?

36
03:01.550 --> 03:03.210
You're saying that young lady

37
03:03.390 --> 03:04.990
is with the opera performer?

38
03:05.520 --> 03:06.610
This guy wearing a small hat

39
03:06.610 --> 03:08.210
is an official in the palace.

40
03:11.330 --> 03:12.260
What's going on?

41
03:12.430 --> 03:13.830
Tell... Tell us about it.

42
03:15.270 --> 03:16.860
What's wrong with listening to a story?

43
03:16.860 --> 03:18.390
Why are they laughing?

44
03:20.150 --> 03:22.360
This good-for-nothing must be making up stories about us.

45
03:22.360 --> 03:22.860
What is it?

46
03:22.860 --> 03:23.930
Talking about it

47
03:23.990 --> 03:24.990
makes me ashamed.

48
03:25.210 --> 03:26.470
Here's what happened.

49
03:27.240 --> 03:28.360
That young lady

50
03:28.640 --> 03:31.200
loved going to the entertainment district to watch operas.

51
03:31.200 --> 03:33.860
Her husband had been suspicious for a long time.

52
03:34.320 --> 03:34.980
That day,

53
03:35.370 --> 03:37.630
he quietly followed her to the district.

54
03:37.770 --> 03:38.970
That opera performer

55
03:39.079 --> 03:40.170
was extremely shameless.

56
03:40.170 --> 03:41.760
He didn't even remove his makeup

57
03:41.760 --> 03:43.670
before the two of them had a secret rendezvous

58
03:43.670 --> 03:44.670
right backstage.

59
03:45.960 --> 03:48.220
They had a secret rendezvous backstage?

60
03:49.079 --> 03:49.829
Shall I call them over?

61
03:49.829 --> 03:51.170
-Call them over. -Yes.

62
03:51.470 --> 03:52.070
Come here!

63
03:52.980 --> 03:53.579
Come here!

64
03:54.490 --> 03:55.090
Come here!

65
03:55.430 --> 03:55.920
Go.

66
03:56.320 --> 03:56.920
Go.

67
04:04.390 --> 04:05.270
You lecher.

68
04:05.320 --> 04:06.320
Looking so shifty.

69
04:06.320 --> 04:07.940
How dare you face these two gentlemen?

70
04:07.940 --> 04:08.670
Turn around.

71
04:09.800 --> 04:10.660
How shameless.

72
04:12.370 --> 04:12.990
Sir.

73
04:13.550 --> 04:16.410
You should send this criminal to Shangyuan County.

74
04:16.579 --> 04:18.709
Why are you sending him out of the city?

75
04:19.709 --> 04:20.560
Well...

76
04:20.709 --> 04:22.310
The prefectural office said

77
04:22.580 --> 04:25.310
this case damages the government's reputation.

78
04:26.270 --> 04:29.060
They asked us to hand him over to the neighboring Jurong County

79
04:29.060 --> 04:30.660
and close the case secretly.

80
04:30.940 --> 04:31.760
I mean—

81
04:31.970 --> 04:33.490
why else would we leave this city at this time?

82
04:33.490 --> 04:34.110
Right?

83
04:34.960 --> 04:38.080
The victim is holding on tight—

84
04:38.350 --> 04:39.640
refusing to let go.

85
04:42.230 --> 04:42.790
Go, go.

86
04:43.170 --> 04:44.070
-Get in. -Go.

87
04:44.350 --> 04:44.830
Get in.

88
04:44.890 --> 04:45.420
Let's go.

89
04:45.650 --> 04:46.350
Lecher.

90
04:46.940 --> 04:47.450
Go.

91
04:48.680 --> 04:49.560
Thanks, sir.

92
05:02.520 --> 05:04.120
Finally passed this hurdle.

93
05:05.090 --> 05:06.220
Wait for me a moment.

94
05:09.540 --> 05:11.150
Dingyuan, who are they?

95
05:12.650 --> 05:13.320
Yulu.

96
05:14.060 --> 05:15.350
Do you remember the day before yesterday

97
05:15.350 --> 05:16.950
when I caught a little thief?

98
05:18.020 --> 05:19.150
He's the one in blue.

99
05:19.850 --> 05:21.110
He is the Crown Prince.

100
05:22.570 --> 05:23.250
Who is this?

101
05:25.650 --> 05:27.260
This is good-for-nothing's father,

102
05:27.260 --> 05:27.910
Wu Buping.

103
05:32.080 --> 05:33.460
Why are you with him?

104
05:34.840 --> 05:36.700
I can't explain it to you right now.

105
05:36.700 --> 05:37.900
Only the Crown Prince

106
05:38.080 --> 05:40.440
can keep our family safe, understand?

107
05:40.710 --> 05:41.770
What are you thinking?

108
05:41.770 --> 05:43.200
How can we leave with him?

109
05:44.820 --> 05:45.790
Father, Father.

110
05:47.540 --> 05:48.640
Listen to me.

111
05:50.020 --> 05:51.020
Here's my idea—

112
05:52.470 --> 05:55.000
we can escort the Crown Prince out of Jinling.

113
05:55.380 --> 05:57.150
We can also kidnap him

114
05:57.440 --> 05:58.820
and hand him over to the Iron Alliance.

115
05:58.820 --> 05:59.550
Two options.

116
05:59.590 --> 06:00.590
Either one works.

117
06:01.180 --> 06:03.180
You're being too smart for your own good.

118
06:03.180 --> 06:04.940
Guo Zhimin worked for the Iron Alliance.

119
06:04.940 --> 06:07.030
They wanted to kill the Crown Prince with inside help.

120
06:07.030 --> 06:07.900
In the end, he was silenced

121
06:07.900 --> 06:09.360
and died a restless death.

122
06:10.170 --> 06:11.730
He thinks he has a choice.

123
06:14.410 --> 06:15.520
No one involved in this

124
06:15.520 --> 06:16.650
will meet a good end.

125
06:16.740 --> 06:18.350
Why don't you understand?

126
06:19.600 --> 06:21.400
Why are they talking for so long?

127
06:24.020 --> 06:25.820
A father and son saying goodbye—

128
06:26.390 --> 06:27.760
it's only natural.

129
06:28.850 --> 06:30.060
He had the chance

130
06:31.120 --> 06:33.030
to see his father.

131
06:36.090 --> 06:37.200
I don't even know

132
06:38.330 --> 06:39.680
if I'll have the chance

133
06:40.500 --> 06:42.440
to see my Father again.

134
06:47.080 --> 06:48.230
The two capitals

135
06:49.530 --> 06:51.190
are thousands of miles apart.

136
06:51.260 --> 06:51.640
I'm afraid...

137
06:51.640 --> 06:52.500
Afraid of what?

138
06:54.880 --> 06:56.830
I refuse to die until I hit

139
06:58.750 --> 06:59.950
an absolute dead end.

140
07:01.610 --> 07:03.940
There will definitely be another chance.

141
07:08.150 --> 07:08.650
Father.

142
07:09.610 --> 07:11.640
We have nowhere to go now.

143
07:12.140 --> 07:13.800
We must find the real culprit.

144
07:14.060 --> 07:15.660
Otherwise, our whole family

145
07:16.060 --> 07:17.260
will be doomed.

146
07:28.080 --> 07:28.470
Go.

147
07:28.700 --> 07:29.200
Quick.

148
07:29.380 --> 07:29.910
Quick!

149
07:43.080 --> 07:43.700
Yulu!

150
07:43.880 --> 07:45.080
Hide quickly!

151
08:36.480 --> 08:37.780
Isn't this Constable Wu?

152
08:37.780 --> 08:38.940
-Constable Wu. -Constable Wu.

153
08:38.940 --> 08:40.070
We're here to help you.

154
08:40.070 --> 08:42.159
Thank you for your help, brothers.

155
08:49.970 --> 08:51.110
Iron Lion?

156
08:51.590 --> 08:52.390
Take him down!

157
09:11.730 --> 09:12.280
Father!

158
09:35.440 --> 09:35.870
Go!

159
09:35.990 --> 09:37.350
Father, you go first!

160
10:18.160 --> 10:18.800
Father!

161
11:19.960 --> 11:21.040
Hurry, aim!

162
11:21.250 --> 11:21.960
Fire!

163
11:30.690 --> 11:31.350
Go!

164
11:45.700 --> 11:46.470
Father!

165
11:47.540 --> 11:48.160
Father!

166
11:48.680 --> 11:50.030
-Yulu. -Father.

167
11:50.470 --> 11:51.230
Father!

168
11:52.400 --> 11:53.350
Father!

169
11:54.770 --> 11:56.100
Zhu Zhanji.

170
12:16.160 --> 12:16.990
Doctor Su!

171
12:17.440 --> 12:18.280
Doctor Su!

172
12:18.610 --> 12:19.560
Save my father!

173
12:19.990 --> 12:20.730
I'll give you money!

174
12:20.730 --> 12:21.790
As much as you want!

175
12:21.900 --> 12:23.090
Please save him!

176
12:23.250 --> 12:24.350
Please...

177
12:25.870 --> 12:26.870
He can't be saved.

178
12:27.350 --> 12:28.700
-I can't. -You can save him.

179
12:28.700 --> 12:30.440
Listen to his last words to you.

180
12:30.670 --> 12:32.170
Catch every word you can.

181
12:32.490 --> 12:33.040
Go.

182
12:34.660 --> 12:35.260
Father...

183
12:36.030 --> 12:37.560
-Father, I'm here. -Son...

184
12:37.700 --> 12:38.440
I'm here.

185
12:39.250 --> 12:39.870
Son...

186
12:39.870 --> 12:41.350
-I'm here. -Remember...

187
12:41.920 --> 12:44.960
no matter what happens...

188
12:45.960 --> 12:50.120
you are the son of me, Wu Buping...

189
12:50.350 --> 12:51.440
You must...

190
12:52.080 --> 12:54.990
leave... leave Jinling...

191
12:55.380 --> 12:56.620
Leaving Jinling.

192
12:59.220 --> 13:00.740
Where else can I go?

193
13:06.330 --> 13:08.830
Take care... of your sister.

194
13:09.080 --> 13:09.680
Father...

195
13:10.230 --> 13:13.160
Live well...

196
13:15.230 --> 13:15.830
Father...

197
13:16.830 --> 13:17.400
Father!

198
13:18.440 --> 13:18.990
Father!

199
13:20.040 --> 13:21.160
Father!

200
13:22.160 --> 13:23.080
Father!

201
13:40.800 --> 13:41.590
Good-for-nothing!

202
13:41.590 --> 13:42.080
Go!

203
13:43.010 --> 13:43.960
Good-for-nothing!

204
13:43.960 --> 13:45.090
Good-for-nothing!

205
13:45.830 --> 13:46.320
Go!

206
13:46.910 --> 13:47.860
-Go! -Father!

207
13:49.280 --> 13:50.080
-Go! -Father!

208
13:51.180 --> 13:52.110
-Go! -Father...

209
13:52.250 --> 13:52.870
Go!

210
13:55.440 --> 13:56.280
-Father. -Go!

211
13:56.470 --> 13:57.330
-Run! -Father!

212
13:59.070 --> 14:00.070
-Run! -Father!

213
14:00.680 --> 14:01.630
Father!

214
14:03.850 --> 14:06.050
A father is the only person in the world

215
14:06.370 --> 14:08.830
who truly hopes you'll be better than him.

216
14:14.700 --> 14:15.560
Actually,

217
14:16.520 --> 14:18.060
I worry about my father too.

218
14:23.090 --> 14:25.570
I've always gone against my father.

219
14:26.490 --> 14:28.220
I'm really afraid that one day,

220
14:28.970 --> 14:30.590
if something happens to him,

221
14:33.370 --> 14:35.990
I won't have anyone to fight with anymore.

222
14:42.250 --> 14:42.870
Go.

223
14:43.460 --> 14:44.460
To Tongji Gate...

224
14:44.710 --> 14:45.510
and stop them!

225
15:17.750 --> 15:18.350
Stop.

226
15:21.960 --> 15:22.510
Mother.

227
15:26.140 --> 15:27.400
Everyone, stay alert.

228
16:24.470 --> 16:25.080
Run!

229
16:26.910 --> 16:27.620
Go!

230
17:03.900 --> 17:05.030
Good-for-nothing!

231
17:11.000 --> 17:12.130
Good-for-nothing!

232
17:13.900 --> 17:14.630
Are you okay?

233
17:24.740 --> 17:25.300
Get up.

234
17:25.960 --> 17:26.440
Go.

235
17:46.680 --> 17:47.810
Good-for-nothing!

236
17:48.660 --> 17:49.230
Go!

237
18:06.840 --> 18:07.710
Hurry up!

238
18:12.810 --> 18:13.400
Go!

239
19:27.340 --> 19:27.960
Father!

240
19:28.710 --> 19:29.440
Father!

241
19:30.770 --> 19:31.600
Father!

242
19:33.270 --> 19:34.230
Father...

243
19:36.650 --> 19:37.690
Father!

244
19:41.420 --> 19:42.200
Father!

245
19:42.220 --> 19:42.840
Father!

246
19:43.550 --> 19:45.010
Father! Are you all right?

247
19:45.400 --> 19:46.250
I'm pinned down.

248
19:46.250 --> 19:47.130
I can't get out!

249
19:47.230 --> 19:47.860
Father!

250
19:55.530 --> 19:56.070
Father.

251
19:56.620 --> 19:58.680
I thought you'd been blown to pieces!

252
20:00.590 --> 20:02.050
Take your time eating, Wu.

253
20:03.230 --> 20:03.820
You...

254
20:05.770 --> 20:06.990
And you're poking me with that?

255
20:06.990 --> 20:07.640
I am.

256
20:07.900 --> 20:09.240
Come on, poke me through.

257
20:09.240 --> 20:09.850
Poke through.

258
20:09.850 --> 20:11.370
Come on, poke, poke, poke.

259
20:40.220 --> 20:44.340
♪ Heading north a thousand miles, treading the surging waves ♪

260
20:45.080 --> 20:49.090
♪ Fierce winds and driving rain don't matter ♪

261
20:49.120 --> 20:51.440
♪ Undercurrents surge, sails sway and toss ♪

262
20:51.470 --> 20:53.930
♪ Even with inescapable traps set all around ♪

263
20:54.050 --> 20:58.310
♪ I insist on bringing clarity back to this world ♪

264
20:58.720 --> 21:00.320
♪ Blade shadows slash through the night of Jinling ♪

265
21:00.350 --> 21:01.620
♪ Flames scorch the edges of fine robes ♪

266
21:01.640 --> 21:02.820
♪ Two thousand miles, 15 days and nights ♪

267
21:02.840 --> 21:03.910
♪ The canal turns into a line between life and death ♪

268
21:03.940 --> 21:04.970
♪ You and I come from different paths and destinies ♪

269
21:04.990 --> 21:06.030
♪ Looking together toward the northern sky ♪

270
21:06.100 --> 21:07.580
♪ If this world is a game of chess ♪

271
21:07.600 --> 21:08.890
♪ Behind it, dynasties and realms are shifting ♪

272
21:08.910 --> 21:09.810
♪ Shaking off the gathered dust ♪

273
21:09.840 --> 21:11.020
♪ Pondering how I ought to exist ♪

274
21:11.050 --> 21:12.160
♪ Cliffs ahead, pursuers behind ♪

275
21:12.180 --> 21:13.430
♪ On the shore, dynasties are changing hands ♪

276
21:13.450 --> 21:14.510
♪ There is no question of should or shouldn't ♪

277
21:14.540 --> 21:15.550
♪ This has always been in my blood ♪

278
21:15.580 --> 21:16.800
♪ How could anyone outmaneuver my open hand? ♪

279
21:16.820 --> 21:18.030
♪ Everyone harbors ulterior motives ♪

280
21:18.060 --> 21:19.190
♪ Who bristles with righteous rage? ♪

281
21:19.220 --> 21:20.650
♪ Who plays the deceitful villain? ♪

282
21:20.670 --> 21:21.700
♪ The chains beneath the water's surface ♪

283
21:21.730 --> 21:22.930
♪ Whose corpse is it dragging far away? ♪

284
21:22.950 --> 21:23.980
♪ Who colludes in villainy? ♪

285
21:24.010 --> 21:25.280
♪ Who stands shoulder to shoulder with me? ♪

286
21:25.300 --> 21:26.300
♪ Since the decision has been made to set out ♪

287
21:26.330 --> 21:27.600
♪ Become an arrow set off from the bowstring ♪

288
21:27.620 --> 21:29.950
♪ Zooming in only on the finish line ♪

289
21:29.980 --> 21:32.100
♪ Whether wading into peril or struck by hidden schemes ♪

290
21:32.120 --> 21:33.160
♪ My footsteps never stop ♪

291
21:33.200 --> 21:34.180
♪ Relying solely on this loyal heart and courage of mine ♪

292
21:34.200 --> 21:35.370
♪ Never looking back, never making turns ♪

293
21:35.410 --> 21:37.530
♪ Until the world is free of cries of suffering ♪

294
22:02.170 --> 22:03.300
Pass down the order:

295
22:03.550 --> 22:05.120
don't let anyone escape.

296
22:05.360 --> 22:07.100
I want them dead or alive!

297
24:20.700 --> 24:21.900
Over there, over there!

298
24:21.900 --> 24:22.720
Northwest!

299
24:22.990 --> 24:24.320
Hurry, provide backup!

300
24:29.580 --> 24:30.270
Go inside.

301
24:57.140 --> 24:57.940
Rectifier Yu!

302
24:59.550 --> 25:00.350
Rectifier Yu!

303
25:00.920 --> 25:01.650
The firearm!

304
25:19.200 --> 25:20.330
Good-for-nothing!

305
25:49.860 --> 25:50.400
Go.

306
26:02.690 --> 26:03.950
Good-for-nothing...

307
26:10.080 --> 26:10.650
How is it?

308
26:11.210 --> 26:12.210
Is everyone okay?

309
26:13.750 --> 26:14.410
We're fine.

310
26:15.400 --> 26:16.260
Your Highness.

311
26:16.930 --> 26:18.300
What should we do now?

312
26:20.270 --> 26:21.600
Until they take my life,

313
26:21.950 --> 26:23.230
they won't stop.

314
27:01.410 --> 27:03.680
Zhu Zhanji, prepare to die.

315
27:04.180 --> 27:06.940
The King of Hell sent me, Tuotuo Buhua, to claim your life.

316
27:06.360 --> 27:09.410
♪ Fate branded you and me with ♪

317
27:07.010 --> 27:07.510
Shoot!

318
27:09.640 --> 27:12.480
♪ Different surnames and appearances ♪

319
27:09.810 --> 27:10.550
Shoot!

320
27:13.480 --> 27:16.130
♪ Doesn't stop us from living as ♪

321
27:16.150 --> 27:20.150
♪ Each other's brothers and shoulders to lean on ♪

322
27:16.200 --> 27:17.310
Hang in there!

323
27:20.400 --> 27:23.110
♪ A time of youth, a youthful journey ♪

324
27:23.130 --> 27:26.670
♪ A single promise to brave storms together ♪

325
27:26.700 --> 27:29.430
♪ In the next life, let it be my turn to shield you from ♪

326
27:29.470 --> 27:32.760
♪ The hidden arrows and open spears meant to harm you ♪

327
27:30.750 --> 27:32.470
Damn you, Zhu Zhanji!

328
27:33.290 --> 27:34.790
I can't believe you came up with a trick like this.

329
27:33.830 --> 27:37.220
♪ Why do the cherry blossoms fear neither wind nor frost? ♪

330
27:37.250 --> 27:40.540
♪ Looking back on this life, who can remain true to their devotion? ♪

331
27:40.140 --> 27:40.880
So stupid.

332
27:40.790 --> 27:44.640
♪ If this life is destined to rise and fall ♪

333
27:41.960 --> 27:42.550
Move!

334
27:44.660 --> 27:47.630
♪ Then let us break through one barrier at a time ♪

335
27:46.530 --> 27:47.120
Zhu Wu!

336
27:47.490 --> 27:48.310
Aim carefully!

337
27:47.830 --> 27:51.320
♪ Together, let us climb over every high wall ♪

338
27:48.400 --> 27:49.030
Fire!

339
27:51.340 --> 27:55.090
♪ Together, let us break through every obstacle ♪

340
27:51.570 --> 27:52.230
Disperse!

341
27:55.110 --> 27:58.270
♪ No matter how fierce the storm, no matter how the world shakes ♪

342
27:56.770 --> 27:57.680
Good shot!

343
27:58.300 --> 28:02.050
♪ Never think of making us surrender ♪

344
27:59.360 --> 27:59.880
Gather!

345
28:02.080 --> 28:05.450
♪ Together, let us laugh at the fickleness of the world ♪

346
28:05.470 --> 28:08.970
♪ Together, let us sing until the light of dawn ♪

347
28:08.050 --> 28:09.180
Good-for-Nothing.

348
28:09.180 --> 28:12.340
♪ With you by my side, this life has not been lived in vain ♪

349
28:09.460 --> 28:10.270
Blow them up!

350
28:12.370 --> 28:15.760
♪ Looking back at us, all the way we have come ♪

351
28:13.800 --> 28:14.380
Xingren!

352
28:15.890 --> 28:19.100
♪ What is most unforgettable? ♪

353
28:23.150 --> 28:25.770
♪ What is most unforgettable? ♪

354
28:29.750 --> 28:30.610
Light the fire!

355
28:38.750 --> 28:39.410
Be careful!

356
28:45.070 --> 28:48.390
♪ Why do the cherry blossoms fear neither wind nor frost? ♪

357
28:48.340 --> 28:49.120
Zhu Zhanji.

358
28:48.420 --> 28:51.760
♪ Looking back on this life, who can remain true to their devotion? ♪

359
28:49.400 --> 28:50.600
You dare to fight me?

360
28:50.880 --> 28:51.680
Fire!

361
28:52.000 --> 28:55.780
♪ If this life is destined to rise and fall ♪

362
28:55.920 --> 28:59.890
♪ Then let us break through one barrier at a time ♪

363
29:00.690 --> 29:04.200
♪ Together, let us climb over every high wall ♪

364
29:04.220 --> 29:07.500
♪ Together, let us break through every obstacle ♪

365
29:07.530 --> 29:11.000
♪ No matter how fierce the storm, no matter how the world shakes ♪

366
29:09.600 --> 29:10.310
Zhu Wu...

367
29:11.030 --> 29:14.610
♪ Never think of making us surrender ♪

368
29:14.820 --> 29:18.510
♪ Just let us laugh at the fickleness of the world ♪

369
29:14.990 --> 29:16.120
Hold on.

370
29:17.060 --> 29:19.300
I have to take you to Beijing.

371
29:18.540 --> 29:22.140
♪ Together, let us sing until the light of dawn ♪

372
29:20.360 --> 29:21.640
Zhu Zhanji...

373
29:22.160 --> 29:25.370
♪ With you by my side, this life has not been lived in vain ♪

374
29:25.390 --> 29:29.050
♪ Looking back at us, all the way we have come ♪

375
29:29.070 --> 29:32.510
♪ Together, let us climb over every high wall ♪

376
29:32.210 --> 29:33.160
Zhu Zhanji,

377
29:32.830 --> 29:36.160
♪ Together, let us break through every obstacle ♪

378
29:33.440 --> 29:34.600
I'll kill you!

379
29:34.970 --> 29:36.270
Fire!

380
29:36.290 --> 29:39.420
♪ No matter how fierce the storm, no matter how the world shakes ♪

381
29:39.440 --> 29:43.260
♪ Never think of making us surrender ♪

382
29:43.280 --> 29:46.760
♪ Just let us laugh at the fickleness of the world ♪

383
29:46.840 --> 29:50.420
♪ Together, let us sing until the light of dawn ♪

384
29:50.500 --> 29:53.760
♪ With you by my side, this life has not been lived in vain ♪

385
29:53.780 --> 29:57.210
♪ Looking back at us, all the way we have come ♪

386
29:57.310 --> 30:01.350
♪ What is most unforgettable? ♪

387
30:09.770 --> 30:10.500
Wu Dingyuan.

388
30:11.210 --> 30:12.120
Stop resting.

389
30:12.340 --> 30:14.070
They will definitely catch up.

390
30:14.120 --> 30:15.580
We need to leave right now.

391
30:15.660 --> 30:16.200
Let's go.

392
30:20.900 --> 30:21.720
Good-for-nothing!

393
30:21.720 --> 30:23.640
Stop yelling, Big Radish.

394
30:24.470 --> 30:25.460
What did you call me?

395
30:25.460 --> 30:26.460
Big Radish.

396
30:27.440 --> 30:28.300
Your Highness.

397
30:33.030 --> 30:34.030
Where should we go

398
30:34.100 --> 30:34.950
now?

399
30:36.620 --> 30:37.470
Head north.

400
30:38.750 --> 30:41.120
Zhengyang Gate is at the southernmost part of Jinling City.

401
30:41.120 --> 30:43.050
You're heading back into the city?

402
30:43.590 --> 30:45.190
They definitely won't guess

403
30:45.570 --> 30:46.830
that we're going back.

404
30:47.660 --> 30:48.680
If we head south now,

405
30:48.680 --> 30:50.610
it will surely be heavily guarded.

406
30:50.920 --> 30:53.180
But we must have a specific destination.

407
30:53.990 --> 30:55.650
You'll know when we get there.

408
31:20.530 --> 31:26.660
[Iron Alliance's Liang Xingfu]

409
31:22.200 --> 31:23.440
Iron Lion.

410
31:24.870 --> 31:25.920
I'm late.

411
31:38.120 --> 31:38.850
Uncle Liang.

412
31:41.310 --> 31:43.070
When Iron Lion died,

413
31:44.440 --> 31:46.100
he was held in someone's arms.

414
31:50.030 --> 31:52.070
You and Wu Buping are old acquaintances.

415
31:52.070 --> 31:54.500
Whether you want to bury his corpse in the green mountains or desecrate it

416
31:54.500 --> 31:56.380
to vent your anger—I leave it up to you.

417
31:56.380 --> 31:58.710
I have to go back and send someone to report to the Chief.

418
31:58.710 --> 32:01.910
Remember to help me find the Crown Prince's whereabouts.

419
32:05.160 --> 32:05.750
He Si!

420
32:18.480 --> 32:23.830
[Zhu Gaoxu, Prince Han]

421
32:25.420 --> 32:26.400
Somebody!

422
32:26.880 --> 32:28.880
Think you're feeding a cat or a bird?

423
32:28.920 --> 32:30.290
I'm not full!

424
32:30.530 --> 32:32.010
Bring me more food!

425
32:32.910 --> 32:33.810
Hurry up!

426
32:36.380 --> 32:37.340
Your Highness,

427
32:37.580 --> 32:39.640
Her Majesty requests your presence.

428
32:51.120 --> 32:52.050
Prince Han,

429
32:52.570 --> 32:54.180
I'm perplexed.

430
32:55.010 --> 32:56.470
Are we leaving you thirsty

431
32:56.900 --> 32:58.140
or starving?

432
32:59.350 --> 33:00.440
His Majesty is ill.

433
33:01.290 --> 33:02.480
The chief officials of all ministries

434
33:02.480 --> 33:04.610
are waiting on him here in Qin'an Hall.

435
33:05.140 --> 33:07.200
Why are you, his own brother,

436
33:07.940 --> 33:09.800
unable to stay quiet for a moment?

437
33:10.290 --> 33:11.010
Perfect.

438
33:12.080 --> 33:14.080
I'd like to ask you, Sister-in-law—

439
33:14.250 --> 33:16.730
are the affairs of our Zhu family now

440
33:16.810 --> 33:19.770
decided by you, an outsider?

441
33:20.880 --> 33:23.230
The affairs of the Zhu family you mentioned—

442
33:23.230 --> 33:25.750
are they state affairs or family affairs?

443
33:27.280 --> 33:28.830
Let's not talk about state affairs,

444
33:28.830 --> 33:30.130
just family affairs.

445
33:31.030 --> 33:32.380
In ordinary families,

446
33:32.730 --> 33:36.260
sons have to establish their own households after they grow up.

447
33:36.360 --> 33:38.530
If I remember correctly,

448
33:39.310 --> 33:43.570
you went to Le'an to take up your fief

449
33:44.210 --> 33:46.070
in the 15th year of Yongle, right?

450
33:47.160 --> 33:49.690
Then what do His Majesty's family affairs now

451
33:50.050 --> 33:52.050
have to do with you?

452
33:52.370 --> 33:53.910
Does Your Majesty think

453
33:54.160 --> 33:55.900
that after I took up my fief,

454
33:56.290 --> 33:58.530
I am only His Majesty's subject

455
33:59.440 --> 34:01.530
and no longer his brother?

456
34:02.400 --> 34:03.640
I remember Your Majesty

457
34:03.640 --> 34:06.730
became the Princess Consort of Yan in the 28th year of Hongwu.

458
34:06.730 --> 34:07.810
Up to today,

459
34:08.010 --> 34:09.469
you have only been married to His Majesty

460
34:09.469 --> 34:11.460
for 30 years.

461
34:11.900 --> 34:13.010
But I

462
34:13.360 --> 34:17.820
have been His Majesty's brother for 45 years.

463
34:18.030 --> 34:20.860
Could it be that my own brother's illness,

464
34:20.989 --> 34:23.110
which concerns the safety of the world,

465
34:23.110 --> 34:26.420
cannot be known to me at all?

466
34:33.170 --> 34:35.940
The prescription you sent through Hai Shou—

467
34:36.260 --> 34:39.650
I have already asked the Imperial Medical Bureau to study it carefully.

468
34:39.650 --> 34:41.310
It is indeed the right remedy,

469
34:42.989 --> 34:44.570
but it is too strong.

470
34:44.690 --> 34:45.320
The medicinal properties are too fierce—

471
34:45.320 --> 34:47.960
Since Your Majesty mentioned the prescription,

472
34:47.960 --> 34:48.739
I

473
34:49.320 --> 34:50.219
am willing to guarantee it with the lives of my entire clan

474
34:50.219 --> 34:52.690
of more than 40 people.

475
34:53.340 --> 34:54.900
If Heaven does not bless us,

476
34:55.610 --> 34:57.270
and those unspeakable things

477
34:57.940 --> 34:59.780
really happen,

478
35:00.990 --> 35:03.690
I will pay with the lives of my whole family.

479
35:04.150 --> 35:05.010
How about that?

480
35:06.050 --> 35:06.780
Pay?

481
35:07.340 --> 35:07.840
Yes.

482
35:10.990 --> 35:11.900
Life

483
35:13.400 --> 35:16.010
can never be paid like this.

484
35:18.090 --> 35:19.490
Do you really think I

485
35:20.190 --> 35:21.990
would gamble His Majesty's life

486
35:22.110 --> 35:24.800
against the lives of your whole family?

487
35:27.030 --> 35:29.440
How do I know if the prescription you presented

488
35:29.440 --> 35:31.570
is to save his life or to take it?

489
35:31.670 --> 35:32.190
Hey—

490
35:34.110 --> 35:35.500
How can the safety of the Emperor

491
35:35.500 --> 35:38.020
be decided by a woman and a few eunuchs

492
35:39.410 --> 35:41.250
in a private room?

493
35:45.780 --> 35:46.580
Fule Brothel?

494
35:47.090 --> 35:48.150
At a time like this,

495
35:48.470 --> 35:49.570
why are we going to a brothel?

496
35:49.570 --> 35:51.830
To get a pass to leave the city, of course.

497
35:52.050 --> 35:52.800
Big Radish,

498
35:53.010 --> 35:54.270
can you play the guqin?

499
35:57.100 --> 35:58.430
Master Wu, you're here.

500
35:58.510 --> 35:59.110
Master Wu.

501
36:00.040 --> 36:00.570
Careful.

502
36:00.710 --> 36:01.570
Please come in.

503
36:08.670 --> 36:09.470
Rectifier Yu.

504
36:09.540 --> 36:10.270
Yes.

505
36:11.340 --> 36:12.530
Send these two away.

506
36:13.880 --> 36:14.490
All right.

507
36:19.380 --> 36:19.860
Here.

508
36:20.300 --> 36:21.070
-Thank you, sir. -Thank you, sir.

509
36:21.070 --> 36:22.800
We are not getting off the boat.

510
36:23.670 --> 36:24.530
Go.

511
36:26.010 --> 36:26.940
Let's go.

512
36:27.570 --> 36:29.420
♪ Along the Qinhuai River in Nanjing ♪

513
36:29.480 --> 36:31.410
♪ I patrol the streets, swaying along day after day ♪

514
36:31.590 --> 36:33.540
♪ A jug of wine in hand, a blade of grass between my teeth ♪

515
36:33.560 --> 36:35.720
♪ Even the rowdiest ghosts run when they see me ♪

516
36:35.740 --> 36:37.610
♪ Through storms and flames, I press on ♪

517
36:37.710 --> 36:39.860
♪ I drag my life along like a rope ♪

518
36:39.880 --> 36:41.740
♪ They call me a young constable ♪

519
36:41.990 --> 36:43.930
♪ But this realm isn't mine to rule ♪

520
36:42.690 --> 36:43.650
Xiaohong!

521
36:44.000 --> 36:46.570
♪ But this realm isn't mine to rule ♪

522
36:44.200 --> 36:45.050
Coming.

523
36:45.530 --> 36:46.420
Sir.

524
36:48.400 --> 36:49.690
You're just going to walk away?

525
36:49.690 --> 36:50.780
You really don't know what's good for you, do you?

526
36:50.780 --> 36:51.400
If I can't leave,

527
36:51.400 --> 36:52.780
I'll chop off my own fingers,

528
36:52.780 --> 36:53.510
so I can't play the guqin.

529
36:53.510 --> 36:55.050
You can just treat me as a cripple and support me from now on.

530
36:55.050 --> 36:56.190
Didn't I already send someone

531
36:56.190 --> 36:57.830
to give you 150 taels?

532
36:58.840 --> 37:00.650
150 taels?

533
37:01.670 --> 37:02.780
You have more nerve than your father.

534
37:02.780 --> 37:04.340
Don't mention my father again!

535
37:04.340 --> 37:05.370
Your father promised me

536
37:05.370 --> 37:06.690
at least 2,000 taels.

537
37:07.510 --> 37:09.730
-Mention him again! -What are you doing?

538
37:09.730 --> 37:10.900
What are you doing?

539
37:15.970 --> 37:16.740
Aunt Hong...

540
37:20.220 --> 37:21.220
Can I borrow...

541
37:23.070 --> 37:24.300
your Xiyueqin?

542
37:25.570 --> 37:26.370
What's wrong?

543
37:28.010 --> 37:29.810
Are you unable to leave the city?

544
37:30.220 --> 37:31.820
Why are you leaving the city?

545
37:34.340 --> 37:35.460
What happened?

546
37:38.220 --> 37:39.050
Aunt Hong...

547
37:40.490 --> 37:41.260
Father...

548
37:42.400 --> 37:43.220
My father...

549
37:43.670 --> 37:45.170
He... Father is gone.

550
37:49.870 --> 37:51.070
Father is gone.

551
38:04.800 --> 38:06.080
What did you just say?

552
38:12.590 --> 38:14.250
What happened to your father?

553
38:16.130 --> 38:17.300
What did you do?

554
38:22.420 --> 38:24.280
I couldn't... couldn't save him.

555
38:24.500 --> 38:26.330
I failed to save him.

556
38:27.940 --> 38:28.570
Then...

557
38:31.340 --> 38:32.860
Where is he now?

558
38:34.760 --> 38:36.020
He was perfectly fine.

559
38:36.800 --> 38:38.820
How could he just be gone?

560
38:39.960 --> 38:41.090
I... I...

561
38:42.970 --> 38:44.220
You just left him?

562
38:44.630 --> 38:45.090
Then...

563
38:45.550 --> 38:47.940
Why did you come here?

564
38:48.300 --> 38:49.030
Aunt Hong...

565
38:49.510 --> 38:50.380
Aunt Hong...

566
38:52.090 --> 38:52.970
Aunt Hong...

567
39:14.050 --> 39:15.530
What are you going there for?

568
39:15.530 --> 39:16.510
This is Fule Brothel.

569
39:16.510 --> 39:17.420
You can't go in.

570
39:17.820 --> 39:18.860
Let go.

571
39:19.670 --> 39:20.380
I won't!

572
39:20.590 --> 39:21.360
Let go!

573
39:21.400 --> 39:22.050
I won't!

574
39:22.240 --> 39:23.300
How dare you!

575
39:27.320 --> 39:28.380
Remember this.

576
39:28.690 --> 39:30.740
If I don't come out in half an hour,

577
39:31.490 --> 39:33.130
burn this place down.

578
39:34.550 --> 39:35.610
Do you understand?

579
39:46.090 --> 39:48.610
Sir, come see me again next time.

580
39:48.740 --> 39:49.900
Of course, Lanzhi.

581
39:54.440 --> 39:58.430
♪ The Golden Hall stands grand and wide ♪

582
39:58.490 --> 40:02.260
♪ Towers shrouded deep in clouds and mist ♪

583
39:59.220 --> 40:01.150
You'll know when you see him later.

584
40:02.330 --> 40:06.550
♪ They call me the Crown Prince ♪

585
40:06.580 --> 40:10.440
♪ But I hide by the Qinhuai River ♪

586
40:09.460 --> 40:10.300
I read the poem Mr. Li wrote here

587
40:10.300 --> 40:12.010
the day before yesterday.

588
40:10.690 --> 40:14.530
♪ Those high in court know nothing of the world below ♪

589
40:12.110 --> 40:13.090
He is quite talented.

590
40:13.090 --> 40:13.820
Yes.

591
40:14.550 --> 40:18.760
♪ The storms outside are just tales to them ♪

592
40:17.050 --> 40:19.010
The artistic conception is profound and lingering.

593
40:18.800 --> 40:22.730
♪ Take off this robe, and I'm just a stranger ♪

594
40:22.760 --> 40:26.990
♪ Only then did I realize how vast this world is ♪

595
40:27.020 --> 40:30.390
♪ They call me a naive old mule ♪

596
40:30.760 --> 40:34.740
♪ Laughing at my honest heart that doesn't know how to dodge ♪

597
40:34.900 --> 40:38.990
♪ Do not laugh at me for stumbling my way here ♪

598
40:39.020 --> 40:43.110
♪ Whose life isn't hanging by a thread? ♪

599
40:43.140 --> 40:48.640
♪ Whose life isn't hanging by a thread? ♪

600
40:47.160 --> 40:47.890
Who are you—

601
40:47.910 --> 40:48.500
Shut up.

602
40:53.860 --> 40:55.260
Before your father died,

603
40:55.320 --> 40:56.720
what else did he tell you?

604
40:57.470 --> 40:58.260
He said

605
41:00.280 --> 41:01.570
he wanted me to live.

606
41:02.570 --> 41:03.320
He also said

607
41:03.590 --> 41:04.920
I should leave Jinling.

608
41:06.130 --> 41:07.880
I don't understand what he meant.

609
41:07.880 --> 41:08.800
I don't get it.

610
41:11.530 --> 41:12.490
I do.

611
41:13.760 --> 41:15.720
Just do as your father said.

612
41:19.290 --> 41:22.180
I exchanged the money your father left me over all these years

613
41:22.180 --> 41:23.970
for this bag of Hepu pearls.

614
41:24.600 --> 41:25.350
Take it.

615
41:28.530 --> 41:30.390
My father left this money for you.

616
41:30.780 --> 41:31.640
I can't take it.

617
41:32.970 --> 41:34.420
Your father is dead.

618
41:38.550 --> 41:40.050
What's the point

619
41:41.110 --> 41:42.370
of keeping this money?

620
41:45.860 --> 41:46.650
Aunt Hong.

621
41:48.260 --> 41:50.460
Was my father hiding something from me?

622
41:57.190 --> 41:58.990
Since none of you want to tell me,

623
42:00.170 --> 42:02.340
I'll find the answer myself.

624
42:02.690 --> 42:03.420
Take care.

625
42:11.170 --> 42:12.300
Your father is dead.

626
42:13.030 --> 42:15.610
These things died with him too.

627
42:30.380 --> 42:30.840
My Lord.

628
42:31.280 --> 42:32.920
All reserves of the Brave Warriors Camp are present.

629
42:32.920 --> 42:34.110
The prefectural office vanguard reports.

630
42:34.110 --> 42:34.800
Just now,

631
42:34.820 --> 42:36.250
in Granny Tong's room at Fule Brothel,

632
42:36.250 --> 42:37.300
there were 4 visitors.

633
42:37.300 --> 42:39.160
The leader was Wu Buping's son.

634
42:39.610 --> 42:40.440
Wu Dingyuan?

635
42:41.030 --> 42:42.430
That good-for-nothing?

636
42:42.840 --> 42:43.440
Yes.

637
42:43.910 --> 42:46.380
The one who saved the Crown Prince at Dongshui Pass that day

638
42:46.380 --> 42:47.980
was this good-for-nothing.

639
42:48.280 --> 42:50.860
He was the one who sent the Crown Prince to the Imperial Guards.

640
42:50.860 --> 42:52.590
It seems I underestimated him.

641
42:53.550 --> 42:54.990
Hurry back to the palace now.

642
42:54.990 --> 42:56.720
Have someone write a memorial,

643
42:56.900 --> 42:58.960
saying the Crown Prince succumbed to his severe injuries

644
42:58.960 --> 43:00.240
and passed away today.

645
43:00.720 --> 43:02.650
But... the Crown Prince hasn't...

646
43:02.880 --> 43:05.480
There is no turning back once the arrow is shot.

647
43:05.720 --> 43:06.320
Yes.
